        <p><seg source="#source-24427-24430">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24430-24445"><rb>蒼</rb><rt>あを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24445-24448">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24448-24466"><rb>鎧</rb><rt>よろひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24466-24469">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24469-24481"><rb>着</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24481-24496">るだらうと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24496-24511"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby>ふ。」</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-24522-24525">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24525-24546"><rb>眞赤</rb><rt>まつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24546-24549">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24549-24564"><rb>鰭</rb><rt>ひれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24564-24570">へ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24570-24585"><rb>凄</rb><rt>すご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24585-24588">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24588-24603"><rb>月</rb><rt>つき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24603-24609">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24609-24639"><rb>紫色</rb><rt>むらさきいろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24639-24642">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24642-24666"><rb>透通</rb><rt>すきとほ</rt></ruby>らうね。」</p>
