        <p>「そして、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24802-24832"><rb>八田潟</rb><rt>はつたがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24832-24835">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24835-24850"><rb>鮒</rb><rt>ふな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24850-24853">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24853-24871"><rb>戰</rb><rt>いくさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24871-24886">をしたら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24886-24907"><rb>何方</rb><rt>どつち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24907-24910">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24910-24922"><rb>勝</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby>つ？……」</p>
