        <p><seg source="#source-25036-25039">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25039-25060"><rb>緋鯉</rb><rt>ひごひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25060-25063">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25063-25084"><rb>立派</rb><rt>りつぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25084-25093">だから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25093-25120"><rb>大將</rb><rt>たいしやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25120-25135">だらうが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25135-25150"><rb>鮒</rb><rt>ふな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25150-25153">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25153-25180"><rb>雜兵</rb><rt>ざふひやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25180-25186">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25186-25201"><rb>數</rb><rt>かず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25201-25204">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25204-25219"><rb>多</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25219-25231">いよ……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25231-25246"><rb>潟</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25246-25270"><rb>一杯</rb><rt>いつぱい</rt></ruby>なんだもの。」</p>
