        <p>「そりや<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25455-25470"><rb>同</rb><rt>おな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25470-25473">じ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25473-25491"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25491-25494">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25494-25506"><rb>住</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25506-25524">んでるから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25524-25545"><rb>緋鯉</rb><rt>ひごひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25545-25548">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25548-25560"><rb>屬</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25560-25566">くが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25566-25593"><rb>當前</rb><rt>あたりまへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25593-25614">だけれどもね、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25614-25629"><rb>君</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25629-25644">が、よくお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25644-25671"><rb>飯粒</rb><rt>まんまつぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25671-25677">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25677-25692"><rb>絲</rb><rt>いと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25692-25695">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25695-25716"><rb>釣上</rb><rt>つりあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25716-25725">げちや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25725-25737"><rb>投</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25737-25764">げるだらう。ブツと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25764-25782"><rb>咽喉</rb><rt>のど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25782-25785">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25785-25800"><rb>膨</rb><rt>ふく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25800-25827">らまして、ぐるりと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25827-25839"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25839-25842">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25842-25857"><rb>圓</rb><rt>