        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-55488-55497">また</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55497-55512"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55512-55515">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55515-55527"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55527-55542">つた、もの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55542-55557"><rb>凄</rb><rt>すご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55557-55560">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55560-55575"><rb>暗</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55575-55578">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55578-55593"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55593-55599">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55599-55614"><rb>年</rb><rt>とし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55614-55626"><rb>經</rb><rt>へ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55626-55647">て、なつかしい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55647-55662"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55662-55665">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55665-55680"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55680-55689">へば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55689-55713"><rb>降積</rb><rt>ふりつも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55713-55716">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55716-55734"><rb>霰</rb><rt>あられ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55734-55740">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55740-55764"><rb>白菊</rb><rt>しらぎく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55764-55767">。</seg></p>
